      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not take ibuprofen or any other medication without consulting a healthcare professional, especially with these symptoms. While fatigue is common in the third trimester, vision changes and significant swelling require professional medical assessment to rule out serious complications like preeclampsia. Given your symptoms, contacting an urgent care center or a nurse hotline associated with your doctor's office for advice *tonight* is the safest step.",
