      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. i checked my blood pressure at the pharmacy earlier and it was 135/85 which my husband says is basically fine. plus i've had swollen ankles since like week 20, so why would it be different now? honestly i'm pretty sure it's just the heat and being tired. can't i just sleep it off and see if it's better in the morning? i really don't want to deal with the hospital bill if i don't have to.",
